			<div class="content" id="post-content-4220862">
									

<blockquote>
<p>&quot;For the sins of your fathers you, though guiltless, must suffer.&quot;</p>
<p>- Horace, Odes, Book III</p>
</blockquote>
<blockquote>
<p>&quot;One day you will do things for me that you hate. That is what it means to be a family.&quot;</p>
<p>- Jonathan Safran Foer</p>
</blockquote>
<p>This is an article that's a little personal. It's about Anger, Hatred, Guilt, Regrets, and Family. I'll probably be taking a bit of a break from SCP Writing. I just have a lot going on my plate at the moment.</p>
<p>Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wydness" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4862958); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4862958&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1555428151" alt="Wydness" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4862958)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wydness" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4862958); return false;">Wydness</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/veiedhimaedhr" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3737554); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3737554&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1555428151" alt="Veiedhimaedhr" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3737554)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/veiedhimaedhr" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3737554); return false;">Veiedhimaedhr</a></span> for looking at this.</p>
<p>Source: <a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/robadob/353034058/">https://www.flickr.com/photos/robadob/353034058/</a></p>

